<title>PORTUGAL: Yield eases on Portuguese 6-month bills.</title>
<headline>Yield eases on Portuguese 6-month bills.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield eased to 6.0882 percent, from 6.2055 percent previously, at the Treasury's sale of 182-day bills, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>The Treasury placed 13.3 billion escudos. The last such sale was on December 4.</p>
<p>--LISBON BUREAU 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
